   "text": "Prepare the north guest suite and complete laundry from the south utility room: wash both the sock and the boxers from the utility-room counter in the washing machine (closed and switched on until the wash cycle finishes), then dry both washed garments in the clothes dryer (closed and switched on until the drying cycle finishes); wipe dust off the tall guest-bedroom wardrobe (against the southeast guest-bedroom wall) before storing the washed and dried sock and boxers inside it and closing its doors; wipe dust off the guest en-suite bathroom vanity cabinet before placing the bar of soap and toilet paper roll from the utility-room counter on top of it; place the water glass and water bottle from the utility-room counter onto the guest-bedroom nightstand beside the bed; put the toy figure from the guest bed inside the open toy box along the west guest-bedroom wall; place the table lamp from the guest-bedroom floor beside the toy box onto the guest-bedroom nightstand switched off; leave the wicker basket on either the utility-room counter or the wooden side table along the west guest-bedroom wall; and leave the washing machine and clothes dryer switched off with their doors closed.",
